-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Public Suffix List (src/data.rs)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

src/data.rs is generated from public_suffix_list.dat of the Public Suffix
List, https://publicsuffix.org/, at the commit of
https://github.com/publicsuffix/list pinned in data/sources.toml.

The Public Suffix List is published under the Mozilla Public License,
version 2.0: https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/. src/data.rs is therefore covered
by the MPL-2.0 and carries its notice. The source form of that file is in
this package. The upstream list is available at the address above.

What is embedded: every rule of the list (names, wildcard and exception
markers, and the ICANN or private section each comes from), with
internationalized names in Unicode form. Comments are not embedded.

